<title>USA: Stanley Works Q3 profit versus loss.</title>
<headline>Stanley Works Q3 profit versus loss.</headline>
<dateline>NEW BRITAIN, Conn. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.42     loss	 $0.02</p>
<p> Net profit		37,700     loss	 1,700</p>
<p> Sales		    672,900		  655,700</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  88,847		   88,579</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $1.12   profit	 $0.66</p>
<p> Net profit		99,900   profit	58,500</p>
<p> Sales		  1,985,400		1,954,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  88,832		   88,718</p>
<p>	 (All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - First Call mean estimate for 1996 Q3 was $0.45 per share.</p>
<p>Excluding restructuring charges and restructuring-related transition costs recorded in both years, Q3 net income was $42 million, or $0.48 per share vs $32 million, or $0.35 per share.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
